TI  - Humoral immune response against BNT162b2 mRNA COVID-19 vaccine in patients with rheumatic disease undergoing immunosuppressive therapy: A Japanese monocentric study.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Sugihara K
AU  - Wakiya R
AU  - Kameda T
AU  - Shimada H
AU  - Nakashima S
AU  - Kato M
