TI  - How Dexamethasone Used in Anti-COVID-19 Therapy Influenced Antihypertensive Treatment in Patients with SARS-CoV-2.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Cârstea AP
AU  - Mită A
AU  - Fortofoiu MC
AU  - Doica IP
AU  - Cârstea D
