TI  - Convalescent Plasma to Treat COVID-19: A Two-Center, Randomized, Double-Blind Clinical Trial.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Ventura-Enríquez Y
AU  - Cabello-Gutiérrez C
AU  - Pérez-Calatayud ÁA
AU  - Cortina-De la Rosa E
AU  - Fareli-González CJ
