TI  - Systemic antibiotics for Pseudomonas aeruginosa infection in outpatients with non-hospitalised exacerbations of pre-existing lung diseases: a randomised clinical trial.
PY  - 2024
AU  - Eklöf J
AU  - Alispahic IA
AU  - Armbruster K
AU  - Lapperre TS
AU  - Browatzki A
AU  - Overgaard RH
