TI  - Oral Corticosteroid Abuse and Self-Prescription in Italy: A Perspective from Community Pharmacists and Sales Reports before and during the COVID-19 Era.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Nappi E
AU  - Keber E
AU  - Paoletti G
AU  - Casini M
AU  - SGCP Group
AU  - Carosio C
