TI  - Clinical and Virological Outcome of Monoclonal Antibody Therapies Across SARS-CoV-2 Variants in 245 Immunocompromised Patients: A Multicenter Prospective Cohort Study
PY  - 2024
AU  - Huygens S
AU  - GeurtsvanKessel C
AU  - Gharbharan A
AU  - Bogers S
