TI  - Receipt of anti-SARS-CoV-2 pharmacotherapies among U.S. Veterans with mild to moderate COVID-19, January-February 2022
PY  - 2022
AU  - Kristina L Bajema
AU  - Xiao Qing Wang
AU  - Denise M Hynes
AU  - Mazhgan Rowneki
AU  - Alex Hickok
AU  - Francesca Cunningham
