AN  - 21a885843e5b432da8c2f425b5d8f2e4f37cebd7
TI  - MIS-C Treatment: Is glucocorticoid monotherapy enough for mild cases?
PY  - 2024
AU  - Sütçü M
AU  - Kara EM
AU  - Yıldız F
AU  - Gül D
AU  - Yıldız R
AU  - Yılmaz D
AU  - Atik F
