AN  - 227a40a4ae9edf659826c8d3deea9bdbf5c6cf64
TI  - Effectiveness of Subcutaneous Casirivimab and Imdevimab Relative to no COVID-19 Antibody Treatment Among Patients Diagnosed With COVID-19 in the Ambulatory Setting
PY  - 2022
AU  - Jessica J Jalbert
AU  - Mohamed Hussein
AU  - Vera Mastey
AU  - Robert J. Sanchez
AU  - Degang Wang
