TI  - COVID-19-induced immune thrombocytopenia management approach: A case report and literature review
PY  - 2024
AU  - Alahwal HM
AU  - Alsharif MH
AU  - Alsharif MH
AU  - Almohammadi AT
AU  - Al-Marzouki AF
AU  - Barefah AS
AU  - Bahashwan SM
