TI  - Secondary pulmonary infection by Fusarium solani and Aspergillus niger during systemic steroid treatment for COVID-19: A case report.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Usuda D
AU  - Kato M
AU  - Sugawara Y
AU  - Shimizu R
AU  - Inami T
AU  - Tsuge S
AU  - Sakurai R
AU  - Kawai K
AU  - Matsubara S
