TI  - Initial Experience With SARS-CoV-2-Neutralizing Monoclonal Antibodies in Kidney or Combined Kidney-Pancreas Transplant Recipients.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Bachmann F
AU  - Budde K
AU  - Suttorp N
