TI  - Effectiveness of COVID-19 Treatment With Nirmatrelvir-Ritonavir or Molnupiravir Among U.S. Veterans: Target Trial Emulation Studies With One-Month and Six-Month Outcomes.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Bajema KL
AU  - Berry K
AU  - Streja E
AU  - Rajeevan N
AU  - Li Y
AU  - Mutalik P
