AN  - 47b5f52ac3e945e2fbdab178033252f3feead0b1
TI  - Incidence of Symptoms Associated with Post-Acute Sequelae of SARS-CoV-2 infectionin Non-Hospitalized Vaccinated Patients Receiving Nirmatrelvir-Ritonavir
PY  - 2023
AU  - RUSHIN PATEL
AU  - Sourbha S Dani
AU  - Sumanth Khadke
AU  - Javaria Ahmad
AU  - Jui Shah
