TY  - JOUR
AN  - 48c717a28e9db095901b68e3bc4f6f898231577e
TI  - Hesitancy for SARS-CoV-2 Vaccines and Post-Vaccination Flares in Patients with Systemic Lupus Erythematosus
PY  - 2022
AU  - Chi Chiu Mok
AU  - Kar Li Chan
AU  - Sau Mei Tse
AB  - Objectives: To study the rate of SARS-CoV-2 vaccination and post-vaccination flares in patients with SLE. Methods: Patients who fulfilled ≥4 of the ACR criteria for SLE were identified and their COVID-19 vaccination status was retrieved.  SLE flares post-vaccination were assessed by medical record review. Clinical characteristics of patients with and without vaccination, and those who did or did not experience post-vaccination flares were compared by statistical analyses. Results: 914 adult patients with SLE were studied (92.5% women, age 48.6±14.0 years; SLE duration 14.5±8.6 years).  Two doses of the SARS-Cov-2 vaccines (61.5% BioNTech; 38.5% CoronaVac) were received by 449 (49.1%) patients.  The vaccination rate in SLE was significantly lower than that of the adult general population (77.8%; p<0.001). Patients who were hesitant for vaccination were more likely to be hypertensive and have a significantly higher organ damage score (1.10±1.45 vs 0.74±1.15; p<0.001). Among 417 patients who were followed for ≥42 days after vaccination, 35 patients (8.4%) experienced a SLE flare: mild/moderate in 32 (renal [n=14], mucocutaneous lesions [n=11], arthritis [n=7], serositis [n=2] and thrombocytopenia [n=1]) and severe in 3 (renal [n=2], gastrointestinal [n=1]) patients.  Patients who experienced SLE flares were significantly younger and more likely to have a history of nephritis, discoid lesions, arthritis and Raynaud’s phenomenon, as well as receiving glucocorticoids.  Regression analyses did not reveal any independent factors associated with post-vaccination flares.  Conclusion: Hesitancy for COVID-19 vaccination is a significant problem in SLE patients.  Recommendation by physicians and counseling on fallacies about vaccination is needed.
UR  - https://www.epistemonikos.org/en/documents/48c717a28e9db095901b68e3bc4f6f898231577e
