TI  - A Comparison of the Effects of Dexamethasone and Methylprednisolone, Used on Level-3 Intensive Care COVID-19 Patients, on Mortality: A Multi-Center Retrospective Study.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Sari A
AU  - Ekinci O
