TI  - Association of subcutaneous or intravenous route of administration of casirivimab and imdevimab monoclonal antibodies with clinical outcomes in COVID-19.
PY  - 2021
AU  - Erin K. McCreary
AU  - J. Ryan Bariola
AU  - Richard J. Wadas
