AN  - 54736cfe2e64bc84b07444beedfe2cdabe19aa86
TI  - Treatment effect of remdesivir on the mortality of hospitalised COVID-19 patients in Switzerland across different patient groups: a tree-based model analysis.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Estill J
AU  - Venkova-Marchevska P
AU  - Günthard HF
AU  - Botero-Mesa S
AU  - Thiabaud A
