TI  - Efficacy and Safety of Fixed Combination of Hydroxychloroquine with Azithromycin Versus Hydroxychloroquine and Placebo in Patients with Mild COVID-19: Randomized, double blind, Placebo controlled trial
PY  - 2022
AU  - Ivonne  A Roy-García
AU  - Moises Moreno-Noguez
