TI  - The Efficacy of High-Dose Pulse Therapy vs. Low-Dose Intravenous Methylprednisolone on Severe to Critical COVID-19 Clinical Outcomes: a Randomized Clinical Trial
PY  - 2023
AU  - Sahraei, Z
AU  - Panahi, P
AU  - Solhjoukhah, K
AU  - Mesbah, M
AU  - Afaghi, S
AU  - Amirdosara, M
AU  - Salamzadeh, J
