TI  - Curbing the Delta Surge: Clinical Outcomes After Treatment With Bamlanivimab-Etesevimab, Casirivimab-Imdevimab, or Sotrovimab for Mild to Moderate Coronavirus Disease 2019.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Razonable RR
AU  - O'Horo JC
AU  - Challener DW
AU  - Arndt L
