TI  - Broad-Spectrum Heavily Mutated Monoclonal Antibody Isolated from COVID-19 Convalescent Vaccinee with Capacity to Neutralize SARS-CoV2 Variants Ranging from B.1 to BQ.1.1
PY  - 2023
AU  - Alok K Choudhary
AU  - David Calianese
AU  - William Honnen
AU  - Afsal Kolloli
AU  - Ryan J Dikdan
AU  - Dabbu Jaijyan
AU  - Ge Song
AU  - Tazio Capozzola
AU  - Vikash Akkaraju
