TI  - Selection of Optimum Formulation of RBD-Based Protein Sub-Unit Covid19 Vaccine (Corbevax) Based on Safety and Immunogenicity in an Open-Label, Randomized Phase-1 and 2 Clinical Studies
PY  - 2022
AU  - Thuluva S
