TI  - Racial and Ethnic Disparities in Outpatient Treatment of COVID-19 - United States, January-July 2022.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Boehmer TK
AU  - Koumans EH
AU  - Skillen EL
AU  - Kappelman MD
AU  - Carton TW
AU  - Patel A
