TI  - [Immuno-inflammatory rheumatic diseases and COVID-19: analysis of clinical outcomes according to the data of the register of patients of the Novosibirsk region receiving therapy with genetically engineered biological drugs].
PY  - 2022
AU  - Korolev MA
AU  - Letyagina EA
AU  - Sizikov AE
