TI  - Treatment adaptations and outcomes of patients experiencing inflammatory bowel disease flares during the early COVID-19 pandemic: the PREPARE-IBD multicentre cohort study.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Saifuddin A
AU  - Kent AJ
