TI  - Evaluation of two anti-SARS-CoV-2 antibody immunoassays for monitoring patients on pre-exposure prophylaxis.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Vellas C
AU  - Dimeglio C
AU  - Joncour E
AU  - Staes L
