AN  - 71781bb71520ade221eaffc9e1de51a4b1d7d80b
TI  - The Impact of Tocilizumab on Radiological Changes Assessed by Quantitative Chest CT in Severe COVID-19 Patients.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Anghel AM
AU  - Niculae CM
AU  - Manea ED
AU  - Lazar M
AU  - Popescu M
AU  - Damalan AC
AU  - Bel AA
