TI  - Multisystem post COVID-19 syndrome and its difficult etiological diagnosis: a clinical case
PY  - 2022
AU  - Martínez, Natalia
AU  - Venturino, Claudia
AU  - Gibara, Silvia
AU  - Mata, Adriana
AU  - Cabrera, Gonzalo
AU  - Finozzi, Alejandro
