TI  - Intramuscular Versus Intravenous SARS-CoV-2 Neutralizing Antibody Sotrovimab for Treatment of COVID-19 (COMET-TAIL): A Randomized Non-inferiority Clinical Trial
PY  - 2023
AU  - Adrienne E. Shapiro
AU  - Elias Sarkis
AU  - Jude Acloque
AU  - Almena Free
