TI  - Case Report: Favorable outcome of allogeneic hematopoietic stem cell transplantation in SARSCoV2 positive recipient, risk-benefit balance between infection and leukemia.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Oltolini C
AU  - Acerbis A
AU  - Orofino G
AU  - Racca S
AU  - Noviello M
AU  - Dispinseri S
AU  - Clementi N
