TI  - Emulation of a Target Trial From Observational Data to Compare Effectiveness of Casirivimab/Imdevimab and Bamlanivimab/Etesevimab for Early Treatment of Non-Hospitalized Patients With COVID-19.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Mazzotta V
AU  - Cozzi-Lepri A
AU  - Colavita F
AU  - Lanini S
