TI  - Mild SARS-CoV-2 infection in vulnerable patients: Implementation of a clinical pathway for early treatment
PY  - 2022
AU  - Pinargote-Celorio H
AU  - Otero-Rodríguez S
AU  - González-de-la-Aleja P
