TI  - Mortality and risk factors of vaccinated and unvaccinated COVID-19 frail patients treated with anti-SARS-CoV-2 monoclonal antibodies. A real-world study.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Nevola R
AU  - Feola G
AU  - Ruocco R
AU  - Russo A
AU  - Villani A
AU  - Fusco R
AU  - De Pascalis S
AU  - Core MD
AU  - Cirigliano G
AU  - Pisaturo M
AU  - Loffredo G
AU  - Rinaldi L
