TI  - Final Analysis of COVID-19 Patients With Inflammatory Bowel Disease in Japan (J-COSMOS): A Multicenter Registry Cohort Study.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Nakase H
AU  - Hayashi Y
AU  - Yokoyama Y
AU  - Matsumoto T
