TI  - Efficacy and safety of antiviral plus anti-spike monoclonal antibody combination therapy versus monotherapy for high-risk immunocompromised patients with mild to moderate SARS-CoV2 infection during Omicron era. A prospective cohort study.
PY  - 2024
AU  - Calderón-Parra J
AU  - Gutiérrez-Villanueva A
AU  - Ronda-Roca G
