TI  - COVID-19 convalescent plasma boosts early antibody titer and does not influence the adaptive immune response.
PY  - 2023
AU  - McDyer JF
AU  - Azimpouran M
AU  - Durkalski-Mauldin VL
AU  - Clevenger RG
AU  - Yeatts SD
AU  - Deng X
