TI  - A Randomized Phase 2/3 Study of Ensitrelvir, a Novel Oral SARS-CoV-2 3C-like Protease Inhibitor, in Japanese Patients With Mild-to-Moderate COVID-19 or Asymptomatic SARS-CoV-2 Infection: Results of the Phase 2a Part
PY  - 2022
AU  - Hiroshi Mukae
AU  - Hiroshi Yotsuyanagi
AU  - Norio Ohmagari
AU  - Yohei Doi
AU  - Takumi Imamura
