AN  - 8fc6594b9b718f6719c714b5476d0f28b9e069db
TI  - Efficacy and safety of GST-HG171 in adult patients with mild to moderate COVID-19: a randomised, double-blind, placebo-controlled phase 2/3 trial.
PY  - 2024
AU  - Lu H
AU  - Zhang G
AU  - Mao J
AU  - Chen X
AU  - Zhan Y
AU  - Lin L
AU  - Zhang T
AU  - Tang Y
