TI  - Clinical Effect of Early administration of Tocilizumab Following the Initiation of Corticosteroid Therapy for Patients with COVID-19.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Kawamata T
AU  - Tanino Y
AU  - Nikaido T
AU  - Minemura H
AU  - Sato Y
AU  - Togawa R
AU  - Watanabe N
AU  - Yamada R
AU  - Sato R
