TI  - Effectiveness of Oral Nirmatrelvir/Ritonavir vs. Intravenous Three-Day Remdesivir in Preventing Progression to Severe COVID-19: A Single-Center, Prospective, Comparative, Real-Life Study.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Basoulis D
AU  - Tsakanikas A
AU  - Gkoufa A
AU  - Bitsani A
AU  - Karamanakos G
