AN  - 9f675679663dbe47fd4c873db8a7d77dd9114ddd
TI  - Treatment-Emergent Cilgavimab Resistance Was Uncommon in Vaccinated Omicron BA.4/5 Outpatients.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Gruber CEM
AU  - Tucci FG
AU  - Rueca M
AU  - Mazzotta V
AU  - Gramigna G
AU  - Vergori A
