TI  - A Home-Treatment Algorithm Based on Anti-inflammatory Drugs to Prevent Hospitalization of Patients With Early COVID-19: A Matched-Cohort Study (COVER 2).
PY  - 2022
AU  - Consolaro E
AU  - Suter F
AU  - Rubis N
AU  - Pedroni S
AU  - Moroni C
AU  - Pastò E
AU  - Paganini MV
AU  - Pravettoni G
AU  - Cantarelli U
AU  - Perico N
