TI  - Self-management and hospitalization in 615 Swedish patients with Addison's disease during the coronavirus disease 2019 pandemic: a retrospective study.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Öster S
AU  - Esposito D
AU  - Aranda-Guillén M
AU  - Åkerman AK
AU  - Wahlberg J
AU  - Husebye ES
