TI  - Efficacy of Nirmatrelvir/ritonavir in reducing the risk of severe outcome in patients with SARS-CoV-2 infection: a real-life full-matched case-control study (SAVALO Study)
PY  - 2024
AU  - Gentile, I.
AU  - Giaccone, A.
AU  - Scirocco, M. M.
AU  - Di Brizzi, F.
AU  - Cuccurullo, F.
