TI  - Oral anti-viral therapy for early COVID-19 infection in patients with haematological malignancies: A multicentre prospective cohort.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Minoia C
AU  - Diella L
AU  - Perrone T
AU  - Loseto G
AU  - Pelligrino C
AU  - Attolico I
AU  - Pasciolla C
