TI  - Outpatient prescription patterns of COVID-19 drugs in the metropolitan area of Mexico City.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Fuentes-Gonzalez MF
AU  - Ordinola Navarro A
AU  - Carmona-Aguilera Z
AU  - Hernández-Jimenez CA
