TI  - Pre-exposure prophylaxis with tixagevimab/cilgavimab for coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19) during the Omicron BA.5 wave at a single institution in Japan.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Kawashima I
AU  - Hyuga H
