TI  - Real-World Experience of the Comparative Effectiveness and Safety of Molnupiravir and Nirmatrelvir/Ritonavir in High-Risk Patients with COVID-19 in a Community Setting.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Mutoh Y
AU  - Umemura T
AU  - Nishikawa T
AU  - Kondo K
AU  - Nishina Y
AU  - Soejima K
AU  - Noguchi Y
AU  - Bando T
AU  - Ota S
