TI  - Efficacy and Safety of Remdesivir in People With Impaired Kidney Function Hospitalized for COVID-19 Pneumonia: A Randomized Clinical Trial.
PY  - 2024
AU  - Sise ME
AU  - Santos JR
AU  - Goldman JD
AU  - Tuttle KR
AU  - Teixeira JP
AU  - Seibert AF
