TI  - Efficacy of Molnupiravir in reducing the risk of severe outcome in patients with SARS-CoV-2 infection: a real-life full-matched case-control study (SAVALO Study).
PY  - 2024
AU  - Ivan Gentile
AU  - Riccardo Scotto
AU  - Maria Michela Scirocco
AU  - Francesco Di Brizzi
AU  - Federica Cuccurullo
AU  - Maria Silvitelli
AU  - Luigi Ametrano
AU  - Francesco Antimo Alfe'
AU  - Daria Pietroluongo
