TI  - Impact Analysis of SARS-CoV-2 Vaccination in Patients Treated with Monoclonal Antibodies: A Monocentric Experience
PY  - 2024
AU  - Nicola Perrotta
AU  - Luigi  Angelo Fiorito
AU  - Cristiana Leanza
AU  - Silvia Di Bari
AU  - Gianfranco Casini
