TI  - Effectiveness of Sotrovimab and Molnupiravir in community settings in England across the Omicron BA.1 and BA.2 sublineages: emulated target trials using the OpenSAFELY platform
PY  - 2023
AU  - The OpenSAFELY Collaborative,
AU  - Tazare, J.
AU  - Nab, L.
AU  - Zheng, B.
AU  - Hulme, W. J.
