TI  - The effectiveness of novel oral antiviral treatment for non-hospitalized high-risk patients with COVID-19 during predominance of omicron XBB subvariants.
PY  - 2024
AU  - Hsu CK
AU  - Hsu WH
AU  - Shiau BW
AU  - Tsai YW
AU  - Wu JY
AU  - Liu TH
AU  - Huang PY
AU  - Chuang MH
