TI  - Remdesivir and SARS-CoV-2 monoclonal antibodies to prevent COVID-19 progression in hematological patients: an observational study.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Vicente-Valor J
AU  - Rodríguez-González C
AU  - Ferris-Villanueva M
AU  - Chamorro-de-Vega E
AU  - Romero-Jiménez R
