TI  - Spike protein genetic evolution in patients at high-risk of severe COVID-19 treated by monoclonal antibodies.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Leducq V
AU  - Zafilaza K
AU  - Fauchois A
AU  - Ghidaoui E
