TI  - Efficacy and safety of hydroxychloroquine for treatment of mild SARS-CoV-2 infection and prevention of COVID-19 severity in pregnant and postpartum women: A randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial.
PY  - 2023
AU  - González R
AU  - Goncé A
AU  - Gil MDM
AU  - Mazarico E
AU  - Ferriols-Pérez E
AU  - Toro P
AU  - Llurba E
