TI  - Lessons Learned from the Use of COVID-19 Convalescent Plasma at Kaiser Permanente.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Tse K
AU  - Shen Q
AU  - Padilla A
AU  - Martinez K
AU  - Salazar A
