TI  - Clinical phenotypes and outcomes associated with SARS-CoV-2 Omicron sublineage JN.1 in critically ill COVID-19 patients: a prospective, multicenter cohort study in France, November 2022 to January 2024.
PY  - 2024
AU  - de Prost N
AU  - Audureau E
AU  - Guillon A
AU  - Handala L
AU  - Préau S
AU  - Guigon A
AU  - Uhel F
