TI  - Effect of dexamethasone in patients with ARDS and COVID-19 (REMED trial)-study protocol for a prospective, multi-centre, open-label, parallel-group, randomized controlled trial.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Maláska J
AU  - Stašek J
AU  - Duška F
AU  - Balík M
AU  - Máca J
AU  - Hruda J
