TI  - Remdesivir in pregnant women with moderate to severe coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19): a retrospective cohort study.
PY  - 2023
AU  - Arbabzadeh T
AU  - Masoumi Shahrbabak M
AU  - Pooransari P
