TI  - Role of telemedicine during COVID-19 pandemic in type 2 diabetes outpatients: the AMD Annals Initiative.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Russo GT
AU  - Andreozzi F
AU  - Calabrese M
AU  - Di Bartolo P
AU  - Di Cianni G
