TI  - Optimal Dosing and Timing of High-Dose Corticosteroid Therapy in Hospitalized Patients With COVID-19: Study Protocol for a Retrospective Observational Multicenter Study (SELECT).
PY  - 2023
AU  - Daenen K
AU  - Huijben JA
AU  - Boyd A
AU  - Bos LDJ
AU  - Stoof SCM
AU  - van Willigen H
AU  - Gommers DAMPJ
AU  - Moeniralam HS
