TI  - Effect of Higher-Dose Ivermectin for 6 Days vs Placebo on Time to Sustained Recovery in Outpatients with COVID-19: A Randomized Clinical Trial
PY  - 2023
AU  - Naggie S
AU  - Boulware DR
