TI  - Real-world effectiveness of nirmatrelvir-ritonavir versus azvudine in hospitalized patients with COVID-19 during the omicron wave in Beijing: a multicenter retrospective cohort study.
PY  - 2024
AU  - Han X
AU  - Gao D
AU  - Li C
