TY  - JOUR
AN  - f736d2e72420794e2b83d9f833ea1827929cde94
TI  - Efficacy of early transfusion of convalescent plasma with high-titer SARS-CoV-2 neutralizing antibodies in hospitalized patients with COVID-19.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Sanz C
AU  - Nomdedeu M
AU  - Pereira A
AU  - Sauleda S
