TI  - Outpatient treatment with concomitant vaccine-boosted convalescent plasma for patients with immunosuppression and COVID-19
PY  - 2023
AU  - Juan Ripoll Sanz
AU  - Sidna Tulledge-Scheitel
AU  - Shane Ford
AU  - Marsha Pike
AU  - Ellen K Gorman
AU  - Sara N Hanson
