TI  - Real Life Experience on the Use of Remdesivir in Patients Admitted to Covid-19 in Two Referral Italian Hospital: a Propensity Score Matched Analysis
PY  - 2023
AU  - Veronese N
AU  - Gennaro F
AU  - Frallonardo L
