TI  - Effect of Remdesivir Administration on Occurrence of Major Adverse Cardiac Events in Critically Ill COVID-19 Pneumonia: A Retrospective Observational Study.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Panda R
AU  - Singh P
AU  - Jain G
AU  - Saigal S
AU  - Karna ST
AU  - Anand A
AU  - Kodamanchili S
AU  - Brahmam D
