TI  - Presence and Implications of Anti-Angiotensin Converting Enzyme-2 Immunoglobulin M Antibodies in Anti-Melanoma-Differentiation-Associated 5 Dermatomyositis.
PY  - 2022
AU  - Mecoli CA
AU  - Yoshida A
AU  - Paik JJ
AU  - Lin CT
AU  - Danoff S
AU  - Hanaoka H
AU  - Rosen A
AU  - Christopher-Stine L
